$b['First Contact Glyph'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: First Contact Glyph - angular alien symbol with a fine black outline and tiny blue center. A Cyberpunk and Alien Symbols tattoo: futuristic extraterrestrial glyphs, techno-organic forms, biomechanical linework, orbital diagrams, geometric symbols, chrome-inspired contours and circuit-like structures, in black ink with selective electric-blue, violet, silver or crimson accents. No text, labels, logos or watermarks in the tattoo. In the right panel it is on a woman, inner wrist, a small tattoo about three inches tall, with lots of bare skin around it.'
